<h1>Text Formatter Documentation</h1>
<p>This site is generated by the Hugo Text Formatter Tool.</p>
<h2>Features</h2>
<ul>
<li>Removes empty lines</li>
<li>Trims whitespace</li>
<li>Normalizes spacing</li>
<li>Removes HTML tags</li>
</ul>
<h2>Configuration</h2>
<p>See the <a href="hugo_text_formatter_tool.conf">configuration file</a> for details.</p>
